---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "[DD Month YYYY, set this when you publish]";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms governing use of the Fellowshell website."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="updated-note text-muted">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </header>

      <p class="callout">
        <strong>Before publishing:</strong> have these terms reviewed by a
        qualified lawyer for your jurisdiction, and replace the bracketed
        placeholders. These terms cover use of the <em>website</em> only.
        The actual volunteer placements and any company partnerships are
        governed by separate written agreements appropriate to each
        arrangement.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Acceptance of these terms</h2>
      <p>
        By using this website, you agree to these Terms of Service. If you
        don't agree, please don't use the site.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        This site is operated by Fellowshell. You can reach us at{" "}
        <a class="link" href="mailto:hello@fellowshell.com">hello@fellowshell.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Using this site</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>You won't use the site for any unlawful purpose or in a way that could damage or overburden it.</li>
        <li>You won't attempt to gain unauthorised access to any part of the site or its underlying systems.</li>
        <li>Enquiries and applications submitted through the site must be accurate to the best of your knowledge.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The site's content, design, and branding belong to [Company legal
        name] or its licensors, unless stated otherwise. You may not
        reproduce or redistribute it without permission.
      </p>

      <h2>5. No reliance</h2>
      <p>
        Content on this site (including illustrative figures and example
        engagement timelines) is provided for general information and is not
        a guarantee of outcome, pricing, or availability. Specific terms for
        an engagement are set out in a separate signed contract.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the extent permitted by law, Fellowshell is not liable
        for indirect or consequential loss arising from use of this website.
        Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot lawfully be
        limited, such as liability for fraud or death or personal injury
        caused by negligence.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        This site may link to third-party sites. We aren't responsible for
        their content or practices. Review their own terms and privacy
        policies before using them.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the
        site after changes take effect means you accept the updated terms.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of [Jurisdiction]. [Add dispute
        resolution / courts clause appropriate to your jurisdiction.]
      </p>

      <h2>10. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms:{" "}
        <a class="link" href="mailto:legal@fellowshell.com">legal@fellowshell.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .callout {
    background: var(--color-accent-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-3);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
</style>
